{"channelId":"UCbObQyMlNSGOowsK44hH-DA","row":["Saks Wellness Center",97,"Saks Wellness Center has been serving the Gaylord, MI community for nearly 50 years with a whole-person approach to care. Our clinic brings together chiropractic, rehabilitative therapies, functional nutrition, massage, neuropathy treatment, and supportive wellness services under one roof.\n\nOn this channel, you’ll find walkthroughs of our clinic, introductions to our doctors and staff, patient education, and explanations of how we approach care. Our goal is to help you understand what we do, how we do it, and whether our approach may be a good fit for you before you ever walk through the door.\n\nWe believe listening comes first, and healing follows.","",""],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCbObQyMlNSGOowsK44hH-DA","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCbObQyMlNSGOowsK44hH-DA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:19:06.725Z","channelId":"UCbObQyMlNSGOowsK44hH-DA","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"2c7deef1726b4d0c49702a291fd38b036a27de0a933fbbfa3a8782938ba5774d","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"460a5fc1c8bf9485f93f0e9e10ace94ac4352ccce9187e17027795d525806dee"},"countrySource":{},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCbObQyMlNSGOowsK44hH-DA","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":97,"raw":"97 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCbObQyMlNSGOowsK44hH-DA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:19:06.725Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":["chiropractors"],"relevantKeywords":["chiropractors"],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"chiropractors","relevant":false,"evidenceLevel":"single_sample","role":"undetermined","flags":["当前仅有相关内容或名称线索，尚无匹配的本人专业简介；不列入职业联系优选"],"sourceUrls":["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jvlNFSTVvRo"]}],"cleanup":{"status":"keep","code":"biography_audience_admitted","reason":"完整主频道简介与保存的采集原文一致，命中本人／团队／服务语境；职业资质仍未核验。","ke